@startuml conv-c4-context
' C4 Context — CONV (conv-service)
title CONV — System Context

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction

actor "Patient-with-session\n(station, patient-session token)" as Patient
actor "Caregiver / Clinic Coordinator\n(via DASH)" as Caregiver

rectangle "conv-service\n(CONV — speech-tree runtime)" as CONV

rectangle "TRN\n(authoring: LLM + TTS/ElevenLabs,\ndual authorization)" as TRN
rectangle "ACS\n(identity, patient-session token, JWKS)" as ACS
rectangle "PAT\n(patient reference)" as PAT
rectangle "HIST\n(append-only audit)" as HIST
rectangle "MIG\n(centralized Flyway)" as MIG
database "Blob storage\n(pre-synthesized audio bytes)" as BLOB

Patient --> CONV : GET /conv/tree (ETag/304),\nGET /conv/audio/{id},\nPOST /conv/usage-signals\n(all patient-session)
TRN --> CONV : POST /conv/trees (publish),\n:retire, DELETE .../audio\n(TRN service-client)
CONV --> ACS : validate token via JWKS
CONV --> PAT : GET /pat/patients/{id}\n(pat.patient.read)
CONV --> HIST : POST /hist/audit\n(hist.audit.record)
CONV --> BLOB : read cached audio (AudioAssetPort)
MIG --> CONV : applies conv schema migrations
Caregiver ..> CONV : (opt-in usage reviewed in DASH; no tree access)

note bottom of CONV
  Live speaking path is client-side over the station cache:
  no CONV round-trip per phrase (ADR-003/004, INV-CONV-5).
  CONV never synthesizes audio (ADR-005).
end note
@enduml
